WEBVTT

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.120
So now what do I do?

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.450
Want me to help you?

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.410
Are you saying you'll join my party?

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:16.700
Then what help--

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.500
This kind of help.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.630
The killer is right here!

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:25.460
Call the City Guard!

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.670
G-G-Ginji?

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.390
Well, do your best in the interrogation.

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:35.760
If you do well, maybe you
get cleared and released.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:39.390
Y-You're kidding...

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:40.440
The fugitive!

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.980
Where is he?

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:46.480
You're Hiro, then.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:49.820
You're under arrest on
suspicion of murdering Martin!

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:28.000
Adult Event Time

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:31.300
Th-The Guard got here immediately?

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:33.590
That's not realistic at all!

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:36.840
What a convenient time
for video-game logic!

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:39.130
"Suspect: Hiro Yuki"
"Crime: the murder of Martin"

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:39.720
This is the warrant for your arrest!

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:42.520
W-Wait!

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:43.730
Hey!

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:45.940
Gotcha!

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:48.810
Ah, ow, ow!

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:52.320
Don't make a guy with
gout have to do all this!

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:58.660
S-Stop...

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:02.080
What are you, a frog?

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:05.460
You seem pretty healthy to me!

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:14.760
And why am I wrestling
with an old man in a game?

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:18.260
Yes, thank you for your cooperation.

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:28.020
Sir, if it's not too much trouble...

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:30.400
You're hopeless.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.150
Here.

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:35.360
Thank ya kindly.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:39.110
What's with the song
and dance, you heartless ass?

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.950
Shut up, kid.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:42.530
Well, good luck.

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:46.250
No matter what happens,
don't say you killed him.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:49.920
Unless you wanna get
hard time and labor, like me.

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:53.050
What?! You mean...

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:57.670
My sentence is 13 years.
I'm currently out on parole.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:00.010
How long have you been serving time?

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.760
Every time you log in,
does it start from jail?

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.680
Just quit this stupid game!

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:07.560
I just can't quit.

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:10.810
Ain't that right, Enrique and Marie?

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:13.520
H-He's completely insane.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:17.280
You're the crazy one. Now get moving!

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:18.200
Ow!

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.450
Ouch!

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:21.620
Hey, there's no need for violen--

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:23.780
Shut it!

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.660
They say he's a killer.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.200
Oh my word.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.000
The look in his eyes.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.460
He's worse than an animal.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:35.050
Dammit. You could cut the travel scenes.

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:37.260
They're attentive to the weirdest things.

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:39.800
Okay. Here should be fine.

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:41.970
Huh?

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:42.800
Ow!

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:45.010
Dammit. Who did that?

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.180
Ow! What the hell?!

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:48.100
You bastard!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.020
Idiot!

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:49.940
You trash!

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:52.650
Murderer!

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:54.610
Stop it. That hurts!

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:55.980
What is this?

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:59.280
Ted's famous stone throwing time.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:01.110
Be famous for something else!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:04.660
This is a stoning!
Don't just dutifully stop for it!

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:05.700
Shut up!

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.330
Bastard!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:07.330
Murderer!

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:09.910
Take this pumpkin bomb!

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:13.310
Ouch! Make them stop already!

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.210
I don't like it either.

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:14.790
They hit me, too.

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.590
Ow.

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:18.460
Okay, that's enough!

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:19.880
It's over now!

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.510
You there! Stop throwing!

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:23.470
Put down the pumpkin!

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:24.970
Aw, man. This is lame.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.560
Over already?

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:27.930
When's the next one?

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:30.230
We'll have to warm up next time.

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:33.060
Dammit. This is pathetic.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.940
Who the hell am I in this world?

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:43.910
Hero! You must defeat the Demon Lord
and save the world of Auberdine!

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:45.410
H-Hold on!

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:48.950
Huh? What now? More complaints?

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:51.160
Release me immediately.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:53.960
If you don't, you'll end up regretting it.

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:57.000
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:02.050
You might not believe this,
but I'm a hero.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:09.470
I'm sure one of these days, I'll be asked
by a king or someone to save the world.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:15.940
Then my special hero powers will
be unleashed, and I'll shoulder the--

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:17.020
Not you, too.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:17.820
Huh?

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:19.190
We get a lot of them lately.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:23.490
Crazies who claim to be heroes.

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:25.360
Ugh, I'm sick and tired of it!

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:28.410
What? No, that's not--

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:31.620
You think you can get off
by pretending to be insane?

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.330
Fat chance!

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.960
I'm too stressed to put up with this!

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:43.550
Any advantage or cheat as the hero is
rejected? I don't need that much realism!

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:45.130
Look, just walk.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:49.560
This is overtime. I'm supposed
to be taking it easy at home!

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:54.560
R-Right. Of course.
Sorry. I'll walk. Yes, sir.

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:08.070
A-Alicia?

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:09.700
My eye!

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:10.870
Hiro!

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:14.000
I swear I'll find you and kill you!

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:22.800
P-Please hurry! I'll go to jail or
wherever. Just take me away!

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:27.380
What's gotten into you?
Don't rush me. That's what I'm doing.

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:37.190
For now we have some preparations to make.

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:41.770
Just try to escape from
here, hah! Damn murderer.

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:49.620
Ow! Damned glum guard!

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:54.700
Ouch! It's so hard!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:57.620
Screw it. I'll just log out now.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:01.670
Reona said she'd come,
but she's totally AWOL.

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:05.880
As you are in the middle of an event,
logging out is temporarily unavailable.

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:07.380
Huh?

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:11.260
Excuse me? This isn't the internet!

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:12.260
As you are in the middle of an event,
logging out is temporarily unavailable.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:13.970
As you are in the middle of an event,
logging out is temporarily unavailable.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:29.740
It feels like an hour has passed.

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:35.870
Given the possibility the event wouldn't
be over in 30 minutes, I waited a ton.

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:38.410
So by now there's no way...

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:49.590
As you are in the middle of an event,
logging out is temporarily unavailable.

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:57.300
As you are in the middle of an event,
logging out is temporarily unavailable.

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:03.690
You gotta be kidding!
How much "later" can it be?

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:06.070
Dammit! And now I'm hungry!

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:10.400
Don't incorporate hunger into a game!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:21.580
Don't tell me I have to
pee in this game, too.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:30.800
Is this a toilet?
It's basically just a latrine.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:39.350
It reeks. I don't need this much realism.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.030
That was close!

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:52.450
Somehow I managed to hold it.

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:58.540
Wh-What is it? A monster?

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:00.540
No, an NPC?

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:03.540
But there was no one there!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.090
Hiro.

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:08.210
Huh?

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:11.220
How dare you...? How dare you...?

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:15.010
That voice... This physique...

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:20.100
Martin? Is that you?

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:23.730
But how...? I mean,
Martin was definitely...

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:27.980
...because I...

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:33.820
That's right. I'm Martin, the guy you

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:35.570
killed!

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:40.410
It's a full-dive horror game!

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:43.250
F-Forgive me. It was an accident!

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:49.420
No! You stabbed me,
cruelly and mercilessly.

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:50.800
No, I didn't!

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:55.180
Remember? You were eating an
apple slice with a knife. And then...

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:05.730
That's right... One moment
I was eating an apple,

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:10.230
and then suddenly I was eating a knife.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:16.820
And just what's so funny?

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:19.160
I-I'm sorry!

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:26.000
Hiro, our promise. Tell me what
we swore under the Kenura tree.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:30.460
I-I don't know! About the
weird-named tree or the promise!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:32.210
Say it!

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:35.920
Speak the words of our
promise under the Kenura tree.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.090
How the hell would I know?

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:41.430
Is it in the manual? No, games
haven't had manuals for ages!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:45.390
Say it! Speak the words of our promise.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:47.560
I-I really don't know!

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:54.490
I know we're supposed to be longtime
friends, but I only just started the game!

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:57.700
I see. Of course.

00:11:57.700 --> 00:12:00.240
So you understand?

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:03.910
I'll have to haunt you
every day until you remember.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.330
Why is that the answer?

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:08.290
I never experienced the event,
so how can I remember it?

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:11.500
It's the start of Martin Time!

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:14.340
This is called Martin Time?!

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:16.420
Come to think of it...

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:21.970
Ginji also saw the
best friend he'd killed.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:27.100
Though in his case, the childhood
friend made it two ghosts.

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:32.060
Huh? Uh, what is it?

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:35.650
I wanted... I wanted...

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:41.070
...to live longer!

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.370
Ahhh!

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:45.160
I've had enough of this game!
Someone help me!

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:48.080
Reona, what are you doing?

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:50.580
Anyone! Please! Help me!

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.960
Let me quit this game!

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:55.050
Wh-What's wrong?

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:58.840
R-Reona? You finally logged in?

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:02.720
Nope. That ain't my name!

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:07.430
Whoever you are, please help me!

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:08.560
It's Martin Time!

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:10.850
Martin Time won't end!

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:14.190
Wh-What's that? You okay in there?

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:17.610
Blood! Blood on my face! Slathered in it!

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:20.030
There ain't no blood on you.

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:22.320
Please! Please, just help me!

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:26.160
O-Okay, I hear ya. Just try to calm down.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:29.120
You're Hiro, right?

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.540
It'll be okay.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:36.090
Um, who are you?

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:39.920
Oh, me? Name's Mizarisa.

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.840
Nice to meet ya.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:44.260
Wh-Where are we going?

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.050
Over here.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.150
A bed?

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:02.150
Wh-What is this?

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:09.870
Come on. It's time to start the fun.

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:11.710
Oh...

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:17.160
Warning!

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:17.160
This will involve intense stimulation. Are you mentally prepared?

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:15.170
"This will involve...

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:17.670
intense stimulation"?!

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:20.550
Y-You mean...

