00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:53.500
I wanted a full-dive
RPG of pure adventure.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:54.580
But hold on.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.750
This is a type of adventure.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:15:00.500
It's a manifestation of pure curiosity.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.880
If anything, I <i>ought </i>to
enjoy it in full dive, right?

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.970
Right?

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.300
Warning!

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.300
This will involve intense stimulation. Are you mentally prepared?

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:11.180
To start, just lie down.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:14.230
I-I got ya.

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:22.650
Could ya close your eyes for a bit?

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:25.030
I'll close 'em.

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:31.330
I bet she's making adult preparations!

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:35.250
She must be one of the prison guards.

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:41.420
She's a fantastic NPC who gives you a
sweet respite and saves you from jail!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:49.800
Hmm, I have to say KQ
isn't an entirely shitty game.

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:53.720
Th-This is it!

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:56.980
Don't ya open your eyes yet.

00:15:56.980 --> 00:15:59.520
O-Okey-dokey.

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.700
I'm ready.

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:09.280
You can open 'em now.

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:10.990
Okay!

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.670
Huh? A dominatrix?!

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:31.930
W-We're starting with advanced--

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:32.760
Huh?

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:37.980
Get ready! It's time to begin
the oh-so-exciting inquisition!

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:40.310
"<i>I-Inquisition</i>"?

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:42.480
N-Not the dirty kind?

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:49.530
I'm Mizarisa the Inquisitor. It's time for
me to torture you. Nice to work with ya.

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:54.330
B-By "torture," you mean
some S&M-type stuff?

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:57.330
You must be possessed by a demon.

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:00.750
I'm just gonna exorcise
that demon, so be at ease.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:04.800
O-Okay. I don't really get it,
but I guess I'm at ease.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:09.470
Should ya break under torture and confess,
you'll go to the slammer.

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:15.180
But if ya endure it, Martin's murder will
be blamed on the demon and you're free.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:17.600
Do your best, Hiro.

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:19.100
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:21.310
So... what's the torture?

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:23.480
Whips? Candles?

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:26.440
Why, what else?

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:30.610
Severing your arms and legs!

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:33.780
Severing my... arms and legs?

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:39.460
Oh, no! Please don't!

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:44.290
Oh, yes! What great screaming!
You're driving my torture instincts wild!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:46.250
Help!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:50.880
Reona, please come save me! Hurry! Hurry!

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:52.510
Hiro, are you okay?

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:53.800
Reona!

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:58.020
Wh-What took you so long?
I told you I was logging in!

00:17:58.020 --> 00:18:00.310
It's been nothing but awful!

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:01.890
Sorry.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:04.860
But I had my own stuff...

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:10.740
Oh, of course. You were fighting Alicia.
And you have a shop to run.

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:14.820
<i>Castle in the Sky </i>was
being broadcast today.

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.740
I started watching and lost track of time.

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:20.750
Wait, what?! Haven't you
seen that tons of times?

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:24.330
With masterpieces you discover
something new every time you watch!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.920
And on social media,
during the Spell of Destruction--

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:28.500
Who cares?!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.090
That's not important right now!

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:38.010
Hiro, what are you muttering about?
Has the fear driven you mad?

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:43.060
That's no good!
We're not even at the good part yet!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:47.190
Reona, just help me please!

00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:48.480
Okay!

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.320
Sparkle!

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:56.780
Hiro, Hiro, he's our man!
If he can't do it, no one can!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:58.490
What?

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:01.250
To be cleared of the charges,
you have to endure the torture.

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:04.830
So I'm giving you all-out encouragement.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.960
I'll cheer until I'm hoarse!

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:09.460
What the hell did you come here for?!

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:12.380
Well, the handcuffs are too
tough for me to break or open!

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:14.470
That's less than useless!

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:17.760
Okay, I'm gonna get to chopping!

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.480
No way! For real?

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:28.150
I can't! I really, seriously can't!

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:33.400
Nice and sharp! First I'll cut
your right leg from your torso!

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:38.200
Please stop!

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:50.500
Oh, oh, no!

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.500
Hey, Hiro, you peed!

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:56.340
You're in high school and
you're wetting yourself!

00:19:56.340 --> 00:20:02.010
Oh! What a wonderful, wonderful accident!

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:05.680
What the hell?
Why is this happening to me?

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:11.730
In my 12 years as an inquisitor, I've
never seen such wonderful bed wetting!

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:14.820
B-Be still my heart!

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:20.410
Oh, to think I get to
cut off piss-soaked legs!

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:22.990
H-Hiro! Pull it together!

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:25.160
I give up!

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:29.540
I'm hopeless. I can't do anything right.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:32.000
Hiro?

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:36.130
So it doesn't matter anymore.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:41.720
Then here I go!

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:45.970
Stop! The interrogation is cancelled!

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:48.350
<i>What </i>is that <i>smell</i>?

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:52.150
Regardless, the interrogation
is over! Put that down!

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:54.320
What? But why?

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:58.200
I don't know the details,
but no more torture!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:01.660
The order comes from the head
of the City Guard, Tesla himself.

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:05.540
Oh, but it was just getting good!

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:06.950
Oh?

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:08.370
What's this?

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:14.670
"Nice Shower Best Friend Killer:
Amicide Who Had an 'Accident.'"

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:17.510
"Who had an 'accident'"?

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:19.340
I-Incredible work, Hiro!

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:23.720
You just avoided the torture with the
special command "wetting yourself!"

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:25.930
I don't want that command!

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:27.390
This is a special trick!

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:29.810
I bet no one knows about this yet!

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:34.520
You found a trick that's
been unknown for ten years!

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:38.360
Come on! Get up already!

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:45.700
Save your adventure and quit the game?

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:48.370
What?! Hiro, you're logging out?

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:52.580
But we had just gotten to a fun part!

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:54.920
It's not fun.

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:56.250
What?

00:21:56.250 --> 00:22:00.340
This shitty game isn't fun at all!

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:01.380
Save your adventure and quit the game?

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:08.390
Screw this game! I'm never playing again!

00:23:45.990 --> 00:23:49.740
Episode 4: The Only One to Beat the Game.
